         <lb n="9a3"/><seg type="excerpt" xml:id="ex088052025-05-2615-53-57" status="finalized"><milestone unit="section" n="2331.4 log shes"/>
         <milestone unit="section" n="2331.41 mtshan nyid"/>
         log shes kyi spyi'i <expan>mtshan nyid</expan> ni don dang mi mthun par 'dzin pa la <rs type="person" ana="corpusmd:named_reference" ref="person:3831">phya pa</rs> bzhed pa <note type="editorial">The ascription of this view to Phya pa seems mistaken. A similar view is ascribed to 'Jad Byang chub skyabs (ID:3864) in work (ID:5507), and it is mentioned anonymously in work (ID:4771)</note> mi 'thad de | dngos po'i don dang mi mthun par 'dzin pa yin na | <lb n="9a4"/> dngos <expan>med</expan> 'jal ba'i tshad ma <note type="gloss">log shes su thal bas</note> la khyab ches la | shes bya'i don dang mi mthun par 'dzin pa yin na zla 2 la de <expan>med</expan> pas de log shes ma yin par thal lo ||</seg></ab>

         <gap reason="omitted"/>
         

         <ab xml:space="preserve">
             <lb n="9a5"/><seg type="excerpt" xml:id="ex088052025-05-2615-53-11" status="finalized">yang rang yul <choice><reg>med pa la yod par</reg><orig>‹med pa la yod par›</orig></choice> sgro 'dogs pa zhes <rs type="person" ana="corpusmd:named_reference" ref="person:3839">tsang nag pa</rs> 'dod pa <note type="editorial">This definition fits mTshur ston's (ID:44315) definition in sGron ma (ID:5292), but not exactly that of gTsang nag pa in bsDus pa (ID:4550).</note> mi 'thad de | de lta na shes bya dang mi mthun par 'dzin pa <note type="gloss">log shes kyi mtshan nyid </note> yin pa cis dgag |</seg>
      </ab>
