         <ab xml:space="preserve"><gap reason="omitted"/><lb n="15a4"/><seg type="excerpt" xml:id="ex088052025-05-2616-04-27" status="finalized">yang 'das ma 'ongs kyi rnam pa snang stobs kyis de rang gi rang mtshan byung pa dang ma byung pa'i sgro 'dogs chod pa yin zer ba <note type="gloss"><rs type="person" ana="corpusmd:named_reference" ref="person:3839">gtsang nag</rs></note> mi 'thad de | rnam pa zhes bya ba rang mtshan gyi rnam pa<choice><reg>'i</reg><orig>‹'i›</orig></choice> sgra don nam <expan>med</expan> pa'i don gsal ba snang pa yin | dang po ltar na  <lb n="15a5"/> 'gags pa dang ma skyes pa'i rang mtshan snang par 'gal | 2 pa dang 3 pa ltar na | sangs rgyas 'khrul shes can du thal lo ||</seg></ab>

         <gap reason="omitted"/>
         
         <ab xml:space="preserve">
           <seg type="excerpt" xml:id="ex088052025-05-2616-02-05" status="finalized"> <lb n="15a6"/> des na sangs rgyas la yul dus kyis chod pa <expan>med</expan> de rnal 'byor ba'i rtogs pa bsaM gyis mi khyab pa'i phyir te | de ltar yang <rs type="work" ana="corpusmd:named_reference" ref="work:3772">rnaM 'grel</rs> las |
       <quote><lg>
            <l>gzung dang 'dzin pa'i shes pa ni ||</l>
<l>               ma dag skye bo las yin te ||</l>
            <l><expan>rnal 'byor</expan> rtogs pa bsam mi khyab ||</l> 
            <l>phra srabs <expan>la sogs</expan> ngo bo'i phyir |</l>
         </lg></quote>
         zhes <rs type="person" ana="corpusmd:unnamed_reference">bla ma mkhas pa</rs> <note type="gloss"><rs type="person" ana="corpusmd:named_reference" ref="person:3839">gtsang</rs> <rs type="person" ana="corpusmd:named_reference" ref="person:3807">'bre</rs><note type="editorial"/>Alternatively: gTsang pa 'bre sgur (ID:3872)</note> gsung |</seg>
